  "label": "Contemporary Black-on-Black violence in Chicago",
  "description": "The statistic claiming 1,891 Black people killed by other Black people in Chicago since 2016 refers to homicide data from the city. This requires external knowledge of urban crime statistics, racial demographics, and social issues in Chicago to understand the context and significance of the claim. The meme uses this statistic to create a false equivalence with historical KKK violence.",
